-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §25 עובדת הוראה לאחר חופשת לידה: after the
-- statutory maternity leave, a teaching employee in a position of 90% or
-- more takes an hour a day (5 weekly hours) off her stay hours for four
-- months, without cutting her pay or position, and §24 does not apply to
-- her then; one in a position of 79% to 90% gets the part-time mother's
-- reduction of §27(ט).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `25 עובדת הוראה לאחר חופשת לידה`

DECLARE `reduction after maternity leave` IS ONE OF
    `five stay hours a week for four months`
    `the part-time mother's reduction of section 27(ט)`
    `none under section 25`

-- ¶1: 90% and more, for four months from the end of the statutory leave.
@ref akn:art_25
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `months since the leave ended` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled under section 25 ¶1` `position fraction` `months since the leave ended` IF
        `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.9
    AND `months since the leave ended` AT LEAST 0
    AND `months since the leave ended` LESS THAN 4

-- ¶2: "79% עד 90%". F-ofek-hadash-base-25-a: ¶1 takes "90% משרה ומעלה",
-- so a position of exactly 90% is in ¶1, and in ¶2 too if its "עד 90%"
-- reaches 90%. The reading adopted follows convention thresholds.until:
-- "עד 90%" ends before 90%, so ¶2's band is 79% up to and not including
-- 90%, and a 90% position is ¶1's alone.
@ref akn:art_25/p2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in section 25 ¶2's band` `position fraction` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79 AND `position fraction` LESS THAN 0.9

`the upper bound ¶2 prints` MEANS 0.9

GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `months since the leave ended` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `reduction after maternity leave`
DECIDE `the reduction after maternity leave` `position fraction` `months since the leave ended` IS
    BRANCH IF `entitled under section 25 ¶1` `position fraction` `months since the leave ended`
           THEN `five stay hours a week for four months`
           IF `in section 25 ¶2's band` `position fraction`
           THEN `the part-time mother's reduction of section 27(ט)`
           OTHERWISE `none under section 25`

`stay hours off a week under ¶1` MEANS 5

-- ¶1: while ¶1 applies, §24 does not.
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `months since the leave ended` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 24 is set aside` `position fraction` `months since the leave ended` IF
    `entitled under section 25 ¶1` `position fraction` `months since the leave ended`

`¶2's printed bound is ¶1's threshold` MEANS
    `entitled under section 25 ¶1` `the upper bound ¶2 prints` 1
#ASSERT `¶2's printed bound is ¶1's threshold`

#ASSERT `the reduction after maternity leave` 0.9 1 EQUALS `five stay hours a week for four months`
#ASSERT `the reduction after maternity leave` 0.85 1 EQUALS `the part-time mother's reduction of section 27(ט)`
#ASSERT `the reduction after maternity leave` 1 4 EQUALS `none under section 25`
-- An hour a day over the five days of §14(א).
#ASSERT `stay hours off a week under ¶1` EQUALS 1 TIMES 5
